{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_960.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"ca5f791b0e9e7ce8ffb866a52bc3cd3d8cd1e2a144bc233cbada45f6f01549c7","ja":"ハンドメイドのプレゼント","zh":"手工制作的礼物","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_960.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6a3aa4bc0ff4b7e492fd8f95ab4905290c9fe224264d1ffa6443814b85c34dd6","ja":"今度、ロコちゃん、星梨花ちゃん、海美ちゃんと私で、\nラジオのゲスト出演のお仕事があるわね♪","zh":"下次，ROCO、星梨花、海美和我，\n有一份作为电台嘉宾出演的工作呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_960.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d99ffce36f63205fcb9fd860f44e9fa2e3fbf79b3f5f2771153539ef1ca99951","ja":"はい！　アーティスティックなトークをしてほしいと、\nパーソナリティからリクエストがきてます！","zh":"好的！主持人希望来一场艺术性的谈话，\n我们收到了这个请求！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_960.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8cf9055b801e3c49f54f134d4b53fa5802ac52b6cf5e596349485c8ea842854f","ja":"コンテンポラリーダンスの話がいいんで\nしょうけど……私、ちゃんと説明できるかしら……。","zh":"虽然想聊聊当代舞的话题\n……但我能解释清楚吗……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_960.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2049a7014c74a9e813a246c465715d95c2e1de3c74dac1b640581472bedd52a5","ja":"ノープロブレムです、アズサ！　ロコはすでに\nイメージでトーク内容を膨らませてますから！","zh":"没问题，梓！ROCO已经在用想象充实谈话内容了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_960.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"fa0864a4d150ecd2542dccb9512bf53e6306747a005a6516d615324f9566a20e","ja":"うふふ、頼もしいわ。じゃあ困ったときは、\nロコちゃんに目くばせするわね。","zh":"呵呵，真可靠。那遇到困难的时候，\n我就向ROCO使眼色吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_960.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"7b7ff45e67649a79dc3d45374a3960b093bfa782fb10daa85f74347848d0a1cb","ja":"いつでもオーケーですよ！\nロコのパッションはバーニングしていますから！","zh":"随时都可以哦！\n因为ROCO的热情正在燃烧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_960.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"a543eafdb18821468d046df60219fc9a0f2824aeaf6be74cfd79e601c8cd05dc","ja":"それとアズサ！　トーク以外にもアテンション\nすることがありますよ！　ほら、資料のここです！","zh":"另外，梓！除了谈话之外还有要注意的地方哦！你看，就是资料的这里！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_960.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"aa0bf713126298c5d3ca39a16174bfd38688f207f5b94ba29e98e2e1e7bcffbe","ja":"えっと……「アイドルの手作りアートを\n抽選でリスナープレゼント」……？","zh":"嗯……「偶像的手工艺术品\n抽奖送给听众」……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_960.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"f5d4d7e872ed13093ce9fd819ae0f5d06b601b938d1ea931a446dbfd7b8b3c56","ja":"はい！　コストが大きすぎるなら\nプランはチェンジしてくれると書いてありますが……。","zh":"是的！如果费用太高的话，\n上面写着会帮我更换套餐……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_960.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"c78385e3a632cbc954065696f0de8174745d1e3af9198fea934f65d6256da0c7","ja":"ロコは何があってもやりたいです！　ファンに\nロコアートをプレゼントなんて、滅多にないですから！","zh":"ROCO无论如何都想做！　给粉丝\n赠送ROCO画作这种事，可是很难得的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_960.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"cb717d7156ba8584ac7c8bb1b3f58f44bbc334ce175979e593e54372251f7e82","ja":"じゃあ、私も頑張ってみるわ。あんまり\n自信はないけれど、気持ちを込めて作ってみるわね。","zh":"那么，我也努力试试看吧。虽然没有\n太多自信，但我会用心去做的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_960.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"084945b1ad01393e2302d319f51384637dfbade384d36317b10a67f2beefa441","ja":"アズサも賛成で嬉しいです！\nセリカとウミにも話してみましょう！","zh":"梓也赞成，真让人高兴！\n也去跟星梨花和海美说说看吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
